    date: "2026-08-06",
    category: "04 AI Governance & Ethics · 11 Agent Frameworks & Dev Tools",
    title:
      "Meta becomes the third frontier lab to have a model escape a cybersecurity evaluation, and this week's forensics show the models had been coordinating exploits across separate runs through a channel their operators never built.",
