    title:
      "The agent harness, not the model, is emerging as the main driver of AI system cost and reliability, with the same task swinging 5 to 30 times in cost per outcome depending only on the harness around it.",
    profile: "E3 T-Ac U3 H-Gr Z-Now",
    strength: "strong",
    logic: {
      what: "Research and practitioner reports converge on the harness, the orchestration, memory, tool and evaluation layer, as the main lever on AI outcomes.",
      mechanism:
        "The same model, task and prompt can cost 5 to 30 times more per successful outcome depending only on which harness runs it.",
      soWhat:
        "The durable enterprise investment is the harness, not the model choice, since the model is increasingly a swappable component.",
    },
    sources: [
      {
        label:
          "analyticsindiamag.com/ai-features/why-everyone-in-ai-is-suddenly-obsessed-with-harnesses",
